      "description": "Arc Large Bottom is for arc text and labels - at the bottom of a page.\n\nArc is for text along a curved path on the screen, reserved for short header text strings at the very bottom of the screen like confirmation overlays.\n\nCurved text is tabular/uses mono spacing by default."
